{"kind": "mod", "id": 297, "name": "Kiki-MedTweaker", "slug": "kiki-medtweaker", "teaser": "Provides a config with multipliers to alter all aspects of meds. (apart from combat stims)", "owner_name": "kikirio", "downloads": 5868, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "University of Illinois/NCSA Open Source License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": "thumbs/459.png", "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:29.000000Z", "created_at": "2021-11-23T16:47:27.000000Z", "published_at": "2021-11-23T16:47:27.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.7.0", "latest_version": "1.3.3", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/ncsa/", "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-2-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">ReadMe.</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Does nothing by itself you must edit the config!!<br />\nGives a list of multipliers in the config that can affect every aspect of each med that is available to us. (1 is vanilla, 0.5 half, 2 double etc)<br />\nCombat stims are hard coded and not affected.<br />\nIf debug is set to true you can experiment and track the values easily in the server log.</p>\n<p>If you love what I do, why not buy me a <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/kiki563478%E2%80%8B\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">coffee</a>?</p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Install instructions.</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Open the zip with winzip/winrar/7zip etc, and drag the containing folder into the main folder of your AKI install.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/UhHRFjL.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UhHRFjL.gif\" alt=\"UhHRFjL.gif\" /></a></p><